1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Mylar film burned at 15.6% oxygen in lunar-equivalent gravity,
below the measured limits in microgravity and on Earth.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
In these solid-fuel tests, initial oxygen reached 22.2%.
The proposed 34% habitat atmosphere lies beyond that range.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
For SIBAL at 18% oxygen, the app finds related tests.
Open each citation to see where and how the sample burned.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
For Mylar at 34% oxygen and 8.2 psi, the search
finds no matching test in the data we reviewed.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Three dated predictions specify which future lunar results
would support or refute our expectations.
